          <notes>UNIVERSAL MIRROR MATERIAL
This is some strange stuff. I originally refused to carry it since it was intended to jam up technomancers. Since then some creative individuals have used it as a defensive technique. Depending on which way you direct the fabric, this stuff jams wireless signals.</notes>
          <notesColor>Chocolate</notesColor>
          <discountedcost>False</discountedcost>
          <sortorder>0</sortorder>
        </armormod>
      </armormods>
      <bonus>
        <limitmodifier>
          <limit>Physical</limit>
          <value>2</value>
          <condition>LimitCondition_SkillsActiveSneakingVisible</condition>
        </limitmodifier>
      </bonus>
      <wirelessbonus />
      <location />
      <notes>Chameleon suit: This full-body suit has a smart ruthe- nium polymer coating supported by a sensor suite; the technology allows it to scan its surroundings and repli- cate the images at the proper perspectives. Add 2 to your limit when you make Sneaking tests to hide. A chame- leon suit is also armored for the wearer’s protection.</notes>
      <notesColor>Chocolate</notesColor>
      <discountedcost>False</discountedcost>
      <sortorder>0</sortorder>
    </armor>
