      <notes>RUTHENIUM POLYMER CLOAK
A hooded cloak infused with ruthenium polymer ibers.
Originally developed for military snipers and spotters who needed to remain concealed and stationary for an extended period of time. The sensor suite that replicates the surroundings has dificulty adapting to the rippling of the cloak while the wearer is in motion. Because of this, the cloak is not as effective while moving as RP modiied armor, but it is still fully effective standing still.
These cloaks are also sometimes used to conceal small,</notes>
      <notesColor>Chocolate</notesColor>
