          <notes>Sound link: The audio equivalent of image link, sound link can play audio (recordings, movie soundtracks, mu- sic, etc.) from linked sources within the user’s PAN (or headware memory, or datajack) directly into the user’s cy- berears. A sound link is a common com- ponent of immersive AR environments, adding a sonic component.</notes>
