      <location />
      <notes>Miniwelder: This portable device creates a small electric arc to melt metals, either to cut through met- al or to weld it together. Its power supply allows it to operate for 30 minutes. While creating an intense heat, the arc is much too small to make a good weapon (it would be like trying to stab someone with a lighter). The miniwelder has a Damage Value of 25 when used to cut through barriers.</notes>
