      <location />
      <notes>ULTRASONIC NOISE GENERATOR
A variation of the standard white noise generator, this model is tuned to ultrasonic frequencies. While inaudible to unaugmented metahumans, it is suficient to blind ultrasound sensors. Each point of Rating adds one die to the user’s Sneaking + Agility test to avoid detection via ultrasound systems.</notes>
      <notesColor>Chocolate</notesColor>
      <discountedcost>False</discountedcost>
      <programlimit />
      <overclocked>None</overclocked>
