          <weapons />
          <notes>The passenger protection system (PPS) is a well known and trusted series of systems and modifications made to a vehicle to keep its passengers safe in the case of a collision or other “adverse vehicular situations.” PPS components include four-point harnesses, padded surfaces, quick-deploying air bags, and in some cases fast-drying foam. A PPS has a Rating of 1 to 6, with the Rating added as dice pool bonus to any Damage Resistance Tests by passengers from damage due to crashes or any other vehicular activity (including ramming) that is not an attack by a weapon.</notes>
          <notesColor>Chocolate</notesColor>
          <discountedcost>False</discountedcost>
          <sortorder>0</sortorder>
          <stolen>False</stolen>
