          <bonus>
            <accel>+Rating</accel>
            <offroadaccel>+Rating</offroadaccel>
          </bonus>
          <notes>ACCELERATION ENHANCEMENT
Using a variety of techniques, like adding fuel accelerants (such as nitrous oxide), turbochargers, optimized air intakes, afterburners, or hydrofoil drives, the acceleration of a vehicle is increased. Due to inherent limitations in a vehicle’s design, its acceleration performance can only be increased so far. In the end, though, there’s nothing like going from zero to gone before you get shot. Acceleration enhancement can be taken at Rating 1 or 2, with the Rating of the modification being added to the vehicle’s Acceleration value.</notes>
          <notesColor>Chocolate</notesColor>
          <discountedcost>False</discountedcost>
          <sortorder>0</sortorder>
          <stolen>False</stolen>
        </mod>
        <mod>
          <sourceid>c53ab210-db64-42ee-8568-d758ac3d7adb</sourceid>
          <guid>dd24b6ae-1b5d-46a4-9a2c-3b91c348f259</guid>
